<description>&lt;p&gt;US forces have begun a land operation against cartels inside Ecuador while President Noboa asked the United States for $430.5 billion in security aid and met with Pete Hegseth on anti-narco cooperation. Noboa rejected claims that former vice president Jorge Glas was tortured, saying his injuries were self-inflicted. Journalist Omar Toledo was shot by motorcycle gunmen and wounded. Fugitive gang boss William Joffre Alcívar Bautista, alias Willy, was arrested at a hotel in Sitges and deported from Spain. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOdHJvMDY5cVRtZXIySTAwRzA1eGRHVnVmVWw2aXNId0hQNlF6RWhNdTQ3VXFYOVI0RU9GUnN6bjhDQURBeXZ3WGRsZHVCejdJejBpcVVWenl6bkgzcnlGckQyLTJpdTJxdEhBTEFpNXRpY1dqYXNhQTZRc3pEb1pUcVh6TnYtZ3JBeDNpZFFVeE1RVHFzZFJjTmI4aDlFYktxWW04dDZJTFBxWXJTTUEyU05rajRoMzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;WV News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQRm1HTndRU0h4UWEwVG9RVlRndnBrRTh3X2RzbTZ4THZ1UEI0aS1vMExXR2IxRG41RlczbmpwRzlUaUpjRUpVa3pSR2JaZldXMTVXUldwbmxFa1RkQmF5SVlZcmhycGZqRU0xakpFR1FfWWR1aFBaYVZGNUlLNW1UcnBucEFPa1E0YUdscjVKUFM5ZkJSRXdNUnFzU2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOTnpsNktOWHBkdEVPNDlCSERla0RGWDliLVBWWWx6a2pJWG1EMFhkaWdNS2VjSDRLd3d6RDNLQkdpdDUyaE1rVzY4dzVNSTQ3R1FBWU1na0Q2XzBGYU16OVZPV1RURDVvN1FjbVl4SXBDTld6eFBicEh6eXdjYnV1ZVZubzVheUM0aTV4REZUT1RhNUI2SkhUdFFiSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Countercurrents&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;European External Action Service (EEAS)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/